  121:    * other â€” so THROUGH THE DEPLOYED PATH exactly one value can appear here. That scope is the whole
  122:    * claim: a `service_role` caller that bypasses the edge function can store a different nonblank
  123:    * statement, because the database floors presence and nonblank only. That is the accepted
  124:    * residual â€” see "WHERE THIS FILE'S AUTHORITY ENDS" in
  125:    * `supabase/migrations/20260811120000_acknowledgment_signer_identity.sql` â€” and the column then
