  258:  * IT EXISTS BECAUSE THE NGO-ONLY TRIGGER IS BOUND TO UPDATE AS WELL AS INSERT, and that binding is
  259:  * the only guard on this path: a row inserted for an NGO account and then re-keyed to a volunteer
