  227: // BOTH shipped verification judgements, for the same reason both GitHub ones are imported above.
  228: // `emailVerifiedFromUser` is how the verified fact is DERIVED from the rendered GoTrue user shape
  229: // on every read â€” never read straight off storage â€” and `discoveryMessageAllowed` is the ONLY thing
  230: // that decides whether a Discovery send is refused. Between them there is no rule about
  231: // verification left in this file to drift.
