  258: /**
  259:  * WHICH REQUIREMENT THIS ADAPTER IS, declared by the adapter itself.
  260:  *
  261:  * `harness/suite-adapters.ts` constrains its map entry to match this literal, and `loadAdapter()` in
  262:  * `harness/index.ts` re-checks it against the requirement it was asked for. Without it the
  263:  * type-check could describe one suite while the run drove another.
