  267: interface AdapterOptions {
  268:   /**
  269:    * The harness's controlled clock â€” READ, not merely accepted.
  270:    *
  271:    * The harness has always handed it to this adapter and this adapter used to ignore it, which was
  272:    * honest while nothing here had a lifetime. Sessions have one, so `clock.now()` is what stamps a
  273:    * session's expiry at issuance and what decides at every validation whether it has passed. A body
