  225:  * NOTHING STRUCTURAL CAN REJECT IT, which is the part worth writing down. `NotificationsSut` and
  226:  * `NotificationsSut & { invented?: string }` are assignable in BOTH directions â€” an optional member
  227:  * adds no obligation â€” so they are indistinguishable to the assignability check however the
