   77: Superseded and deleted: `/pm-next`, `/item-loop`, `/dev-start`, `/dev-end`, `/bind`, `/bound`,
   78: `/pm-done`, the `bindings/` directory, the PM-acknowledgment file, and the four declared buckets.
